      "q": "How much does National Aeronautics and Space Administration spend on contracts?",
      "a": "The National Aeronautics and Space Administration obligated $11.2B in FY2026 to date. The National Aeronautics and Space Administration completed 6,683 awards with an average award size of $1.7M, and obligations fell 29.2% year over year. Historical obligations were $15B in FY21, $15.2B in FY22, $16.1B in FY23, $15B in FY24, and $15.8B in FY25."
